  "prefLabel": "Nur 502.02 Noncompliance with Ethical Requirements as Unprofessional Conduct",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nur 502.02 Noncompliance with Ethical Requirements as Unprofessional Conduct. The ethical requirements set forth in this part shall bind all licensees, and noncompliance with these requirements shall constitute unprofessional conduct as used in NH RSA 326-B:37, II.(h).\n\nSource. #11117, eff 6-9-16; ss by #12070, eff 1-1-17; ss by #14297, eff 8-25-25, EXPIRES: 8-25-35",
